notes.content:
Greetings, comrades! 

Our game will be a part of this year's PAX East event, taking place March 21–24 in Boston! If you're at the event, be sure to visit our booth. 

In honor of this event, we have prepared a new Union of Gnomes demo. Join the rugged gnomes in their desperate struggle against the oppressive Snow White and her underlings. 

[previewyoutube=iDO0uFmrqBI;full][/previewyoutube]

The demo will feature: 
[list]
[*] Three story chapters;
[*] Five missions;
[*] Two heroes with different skills and characteristics;
[*] Three bosses: Warden, Crazed Hag, and Little Red Riding Hood;
[*] The first secret quest – only the riskiest of players can open it, and only the most attentive will be able to solve its riddle (P.S.: look for the hint in the game trailer);
[*] New harmful and dangerous enemies;
[*] Updated design of maps and interfaces;
[*] A lot of cool new cards! 
[/list]
Play, stream, and share your impressions of the game here or on [url=https://discord.gg/M83fnAbgWT]Discord[/url]. Let's come together; Snow White doesn't stand a chance.

Free the Gnomes! 
The Union of Gnomes Team
